.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt INTEL_GTT 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm intel_gtt
.Nd Dump the contents of an Intel GPU's GTT
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Ss "SYNOPSIS"
.Bd -literal
     intel_gtt
.Ed
.Ss "DESCRIPTION"
.Bd -literal
     intel_gtt is a tool to view the contents of the GTT on an Intel GPU. The
     GTT is the page table that maps between GPU addresses and system memory.
     This tool can be useful in debugging the Linux AGP driver initialization
     of the chip or in debugging later overwriting of the GTT with garbage
     data.
.Ed
